meta {
  name: 05 - Delete
  seq: 5
}

docs {
  Tears down a document entirely: terminates its Temporal workflow, deletes all vector
  store chunks, removes every version's object from MinIO (`{{documentId}}/*` prefix, not
  just the latest), deletes the Mongo document, and deletes its revision history. There is
  no soft-delete/undo.
}
